abstract: "A lightweight R Shiny app for reviewing a gene or variant across MyGene, MyVariant, ClinVar, gnomAD, Ensembl VEP, GTEx, STRING, Open Targets, Monarch/HPO, Europe PMC, AlphaFold, and UniProt in one dashboard, with an optional bring-your-own-key AI assistant."
